Output docs/add.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1020
Set Height 300
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type "source docs/demo/setup.sh"
Enter
Show

Sleep 500ms
Type "clauder add carol"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type@20ms "sk-ant-oat01-demo-carol"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 600ms
Type "client work"
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Type "clauder carol -c"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
